{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31020","headline":"闻官军破吉浪戎小而固虑史氏遗忽因记爲二章 二 · 薛能","name":"闻官军破吉浪戎小而固虑史氏遗忽因记爲二章 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泸水断嚣氛，妖巢已自焚。\n汉江无敌国，蛮物在回军。\n越雟通游国，苴哶闭聚蚊。\n空余罗凤曲，哀思满边云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31020.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31020","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}